# Flash protection policy for the protected baseline B120.
# Scripts may source this file for stronger guardrails.
#
# Core policy:
# - SNR 960148546 is Master_Anchor and is protected by default.
# - Current frozen Master_Anchor CDC identity:
#     /dev/serial/by-id/usb-Master_Anchor_BioSpur_BLE_Control_87EA2F4A526C5A02-if00
#     USB serial short: 87EA2F4A526C5A02
# - Master_Tag may be unplugged. Missing Master_Tag USB/CDC enumeration does
#   not change the role of SNR 960148546 and must not permit Tag images here.
# - Current verified Master_Tag CDC identity:
#     /dev/serial/by-id/usb-Master_Tag_BioSpur_BLE_Control_6918E0384172A49F-if00
#     USB serial short: 6918E0384172A49F
