#     CONFIG_USB_DEVICE_MANUFACTURER="Master_Tag"
#     CONFIG_USB_DEVICE_PRODUCT="BioSpur_BLE_Control"
# - Before any flash, scripts should print:
#     SNR -> logical role -> image path
# - If an image path/name contains "master-tag", scripts must refuse to flash
#   SNR 960148546.
# - If an image path/name contains "master-anchor", scripts must refuse to flash
#   SNR 1050070698.
# - Master_Anchor carrier builds may only embed Anchor OTA payloads.
# - Master_Tag carrier builds may only embed Tag OTA payloads.
# - Never build or flash a Master carrier when the embedded OTA payload kind
