#   Tag / Master_Tag images is recorded in:
#     .protec/full_system_freeze_20260512.env
#   Use that manifest when restoring the whole system to the 2026-05-12 point.
# - Emergency restored full-speed Tag/Master_Tag baseline is recorded in:
